Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs24}上面飛的有小天使 大耳鼠(又譯 外星小叮叮)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等等 等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24年裏(1980-2003) 我們經歷了無數的冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這全是托了大家的福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 現在是25周年特別紀念電影
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從以前開始不管發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一直在你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 現在由我正式為大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 老鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就能見到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這不是叫你練習不接住球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好找回來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:09:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為你沒接到球呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家啦 回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了 你要小心蛇喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好深
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會游泳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 哪兒 哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下 好癢呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 明天見喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法呀 小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在約會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 發條老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有我在 大雄什麼也做不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不要跟著我 不行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽絕對不會同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 小狗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 老鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這小狗是怎麽回事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁媽媽還沒發覺的時候 放到房間去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次被發現的是距今3億年前的遺址
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懷疑是在人類甚至在恐龍誕生以前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被判斷為具有很高的文明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在經過許多考古學家和文人的研究後
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在已經受到了世界各國的注視
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來的新聞...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆的點心在冰箱裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 多謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫什麼名字好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 「汪」在英語是[一]的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:47.48,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,注：「汪」跟英語的「ONE」發音相近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫小一怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 嗯 不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:14:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問題是能瞞著媽媽多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『掛壁式狗窩』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 只好先把他養在這
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放在這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 這是你的家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼可愛 怎麼會被丟棄的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,買什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹莢魚怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹莢魚啊 那就要這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多給點嘛 大伯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家有個人要吃兩人份的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多給點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 就送你一條吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼 這些混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 真是群無法無天的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 過來打個招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香將來要當我新娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 她是靜香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好聰明呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是所謂「物似主人形」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭啦 也不用這麽大反應吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你居然會主動做功課啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真好 不用做功課
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個劍玉果然是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是大雄 寫成大狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這是我小時候 奶奶買給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界沒有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-沒有可以束縛你的東西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你爲何如此緩慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繩子斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝小一 謝謝 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 會被媽媽發現的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰在外面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒見過的貓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是覺得那只小貓好可憐是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被誰丟了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來一直過得很辛苦的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 你也餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天起它就是你的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被雨淋透了 就叫落湯貓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來 它們的食物成了問題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好想辦法才行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偶爾經過 發現它們被丟在管子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去太可憐了 你幫我想想辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 媽媽還在睡午覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼為難的時候 哆啦A夢跑到哪裡去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聼了你們一定嚇一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『免費食物製造機』
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空氣為原材料培養出小球藻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以根據貓和狗的喜好 製造出他們喜歡的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣食物的問題就解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個東西很貴的 可要小心使用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就覺得有古怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近冰箱裡的食物經常少了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被發現就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『隨意門』
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去遠處的深山裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有狗的叫聲 之前就很可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 新聞有報道過
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人把不要的貓狗丟在了山裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太過分了 但是怎麼都跑到這裡來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:21:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土地被開發 改造成別墅
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這些小狗們怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『縮微燈』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個地方怎麼行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之在找到好的地方之前先忍耐著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 老鼠 討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.63,0:21:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在這裏做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這麼一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易來到世上卻沒地方住 太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以隨便丟棄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 是人不好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在還沒有人類出現的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它們帶到那遙遠的過去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有恐龍 沒有欺負貓跟狗的動物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遙遠的過去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 就是3億年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 小一 這裡的全部都是你們的世界哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這裡有食物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 過來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這個的話就不用擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.77,0:23:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 小一 使用方法是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又聽不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『進化退化光線槍』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,調到進化的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}站起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.87,0:23:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來比大雄還聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 聽得懂我的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}小夫 我們到那邊去練習棒球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.34,0:24:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 按這個鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.97,0:24:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.37,0:24:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後按這個紅色按紐 明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 你試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.19,0:24:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小一
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.95,0:24:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來來來
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真頑皮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.82,0:24:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界沒有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.98,0:24:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得真棒 學得好快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好 小一 你可是大家的領袖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了 這就是你們的旗幟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.15,0:25:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國旗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼是漩渦呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.05,0:25:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄的名字嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是野貓野狗的野
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不都一樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.11,0:25:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是單純的思維啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.92,0:25:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.77,0:25:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 明天會再來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.49,0:25:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們約定好 明天一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.06,0:25:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.68,0:26:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是的 不要隨便用我的『後備百寶袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是道歉了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:30.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.29,0:26:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒聽到我說嗎 你們真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你要說教的話到了那再說不遲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我就這麼寵他呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光錯轉 時光錯轉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想想辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.89,0:27:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了按調節鍵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.17,0:27:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和昨天不一樣的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來設定是3億年前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在卻晚了一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是昨天的千年後的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.85,0:27:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.61,0:27:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.87,0:27:59.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是城市 已經有城市了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只過了千年就已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.37,0:28:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我們住的城市一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.05,0:28:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有誰過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.82,0:28:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.59,0:28:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個無聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜古對電影太過於講究了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧見了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.06,0:28:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓狗穿著人的衣服像人一樣在行走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.87,0:28:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且說的是日語
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只過了一千年而已 就進化到了這個程度
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 難道是因為...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.38,0:28:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把『進化退化光線槍』忘在那兒的關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.69,0:28:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼 那麼小一他們...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.62,0:28:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用了那個 進化成這個樣子了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.87,0:28:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小一怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.51,0:28:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然已經不在這了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.86,0:28:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 和他約好一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點修好『時光機』 回到千年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有部分零件被捲走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.81,0:29:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們該怎麼辦呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.17,0:29:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 以這個國家的文明程度
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以找到零件的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.46,0:29:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.54,0:29:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只要修好了 我們就可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『貓狗耳飾』
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個就可以變成這個世界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 我變成小貓了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.19,0:29:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我當然是用貓耳飾了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.48,0:29:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是狸貓嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.01,0:29:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太失禮了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.85,0:29:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.64,0:29:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小一
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.97,0:29:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就去這個世界探險吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.43,0:29:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快點呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搽了就能快速長毛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.23,0:30:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有生毛水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.99,0:30:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長成獅子了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.03,0:30:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦樂園25週年
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時速300公里遊樂車
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多夢般的冒險
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.91,0:30:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等著大家喲
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.06,0:30:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害呀 真是個大都市
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.41,0:30:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.93,0:30:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗是警察啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.21,0:30:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路的是小貓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 從剛才開始 我們就好像被當笑話在看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個 我肚子可餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.17,0:30:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空氣生成的小球藻製造的免費食物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.69,0:31:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『免費食物製造機 』作成的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.97,0:31:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.55,0:31:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,調味不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.28,0:31:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被改造過的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光錯亂是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說 在一個時光隧道和另一個纏繞住了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們才被捲到了千年後啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.52,0:31:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心...跳...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真悅耳的歌聲
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.11,0:32:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思 比起我的還差遠了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.44,0:32:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.02,0:32:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山貓軒的歌姬 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.45,0:32:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 我叫哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:33:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請叫我哆啦A夢 請收下這個
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.44,0:33:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.37,0:33:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是初次見到你這樣的貓族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓 你是說我是貓嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是『七色鈴』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有銅鑼燒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢的魔術很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說我都是22世紀的貓型機器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 等等我 我馬上就來
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.35,0:33:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.35,0:33:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來中毒頗深呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.68,0:33:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 這個 那個 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.79,0:33:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.31,0:33:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.24,0:33:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搶別人的東西可是不好的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快還回來
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.37,0:33:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是你們的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 那就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.18,0:34:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 快追
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.27,0:34:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.90,0:34:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那邊逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.26,0:34:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快還回來
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.49,0:34:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.28,0:34:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.26,0:34:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『念力眼藥水』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.28,0:34:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痲
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.84,0:34:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中念力
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.35,0:34:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過來這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.61,0:34:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.66,0:34:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.51,0:34:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.50,0:34:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:35:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.37,0:35:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.51,0:35:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真行呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然跑的這麼快
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個不是諾雷珠 還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你是小一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.48,0:35:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.81,0:35:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你是從哪個地區來的 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.29,0:35:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從生下來就一直叫小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.87,0:35:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.33,0:36:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 大雄 都過了千年了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.89,0:36:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一不可能在的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.41,0:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 別管那個啦 我聽他們説了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.78,0:36:17.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}只是個鈴鐺而已
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.20,0:36:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說了什麽了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.83,0:36:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說大家都是孤兒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.02,0:36:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子和父母一起去了貓傑啦遊樂園玩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.96,0:36:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只有我們回來了 他們都失蹤了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.71,0:36:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爸爸也是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.57,0:36:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎的爸爸也是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.66,0:36:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子的父母是數學家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.24,0:36:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古的爸爸是電腦技術專家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有太郎的爸爸 在這裡的修理工廠工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這當中一定有什麼聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.43,0:37:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去過了 但他們都偏袒貓傑啦遊樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不相信我們
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.22,0:37:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說 貓傑啦遊樂園的社長貓傑啦是有錢人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.21,0:37:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一任的總統候選人 很有勢力的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.63,0:37:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以大家就聚在了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.60,0:37:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起一個人要好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.39,0:37:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家合力一起去查要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.89,0:37:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我感覺貓傑啦遊樂園裡隱藏了天大的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.42,0:37:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要把他找出來
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.21,0:37:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有個好東西要給大家看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要多事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.08,0:37:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們也來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.95,0:37:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀 我也正這麼想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.08,0:37:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我們是正義的夥伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.43,0:37:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家一起攜手幹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.69,0:37:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連衣服都買不起還真是讓人感動呀
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.36,0:38:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連衣服都買不起是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.23,0:38:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 這不是內衣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個還是赤裸裸的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.02,0:38:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『換衣服照相機』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.17,0:38:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一想到原來在夏咪面前沒穿衣服就...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.21,0:38:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 真是失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.46,0:38:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 這是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那一定要好好注意這隻貓
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.47,0:38:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.46,0:38:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的事在這本黑暗默示錄中有記載
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.44,0:38:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得到機械構造的貓的話
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.09,0:39:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要佔領人類世界簡直是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.91,0:39:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八啊 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.52,0:39:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.00,0:39:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要推了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.57,0:39:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了這個就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 不可以偷東西
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.32,0:40:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.76,0:40:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快還回去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要囉哩囉嗦的說教
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大家都到哪去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.85,0:40:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是去了貓傑啦遊樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.68,0:40:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.55,0:40:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝各位有愉快的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.73,0:40:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到貓傑啦遊樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.51,0:41:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不是來玩的 不要擅自行動
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.94,0:41:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聼好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.27,0:41:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是貓爪機
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.67,0:41:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要玩那個
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.86,0:41:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靜香 那個怎麼樣呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.32,0:41:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}不錯似的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.62,0:41:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.43,0:41:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛說就...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.08,0:41:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是看起來很好玩的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.84,0:41:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.74,0:41:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.09,0:41:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.56,0:42:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家請慢慢下車
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你也樂在其中了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.24,0:42:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.93,0:42:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.78,0:42:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾雷珠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.15,0:42:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.22,0:42:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了這個就沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.68,0:42:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊沒錯吧 別挖錯到運河了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 不要擔心 我的計算不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.12,0:42:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為小八不會游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.47,0:42:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣的 太郎 拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.39,0:43:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦遊樂園25週年特別節目 有請夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.65,0:43:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.46,0:43:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.48,0:43:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家往那邊逃
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.12,0:43:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『發光粉』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.39,0:43:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.70,0:43:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麽事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:43:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.51,0:44:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你們會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.92,0:44:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們才是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.92,0:44:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是來找貓傑啦遊樂園的秘密的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.14,0:44:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個地下很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 已經不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.10,0:44:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我們快出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.99,0:44:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.53,0:44:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣空手而回嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.73,0:44:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.95,0:44:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 危險
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.78,0:44:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.27,0:44:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 達古 知子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.66,0:44:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.09,0:44:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的 有哆啦A夢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.18,0:44:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要這麽關心我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.69,0:44:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}小八 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.80,0:44:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.64,0:45:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你們是為了什麼來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.25,0:45:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了赴約
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.86,0:45:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赴約？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.85,0:45:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地鼠手套』
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.37,0:45:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的小一和我很像嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.54,0:45:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.22,0:45:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連諾雷珠都不用就...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.83,0:45:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾雷珠是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.67,0:45:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真是什麼也不知道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.73,0:45:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是讓所有的機器啟動的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.72,0:45:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.45,0:45:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能量源呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.23,0:45:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 看來我的能量也沒多少了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.75,0:45:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎接力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.04,0:45:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交給我吧 開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.94,0:45:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.12,0:46:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.41,0:46:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大總統 地震是由隕石落下引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.88,0:46:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去調查傷亡的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.82,0:46:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具體情況還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.78,0:46:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推測隕石墜落地點是在東北山嶽附近
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直徑在20-30米左右
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.92,0:46:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 20-30米
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.24,0:46:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,區區20-30米左右就能造成那麽大的震蕩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.58,0:46:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諸位 我們不能再這樣繼續欺騙民眾了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.14,0:46:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該立即把計畫發表出去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.36,0:46:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大總統
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.04,0:46:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 貓傑啦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.66,0:46:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在只有36個小時了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.68,0:46:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我可以做的 請您儘管說
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:47:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對你平日的相助真是萬分感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.17,0:47:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於貓狗國這是我應該做的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.97,0:47:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦閣下 差不多是時候了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.02,0:47:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定這個是...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.36,0:48:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.04,0:48:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.79,0:48:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.25,0:48:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.17,0:48:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八的媽媽是貓？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.69,0:48:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八是小時候被撿來的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.00,0:48:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來大家是被迫在這裡工作
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.87,0:48:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想想辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.86,0:48:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.23,0:48:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.15,0:48:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子 不要擅自行動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.70,0:48:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們從哪進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.34,0:48:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是什麼可疑份子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.29,0:48:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.86,0:48:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看見了 就得把你們抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.66,0:48:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.08,0:48:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 快想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.76,0:49:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是第6小隊 發現入侵者 快來支援
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.69,0:49:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.25,0:49:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.28,0:49:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八也來了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.65,0:49:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.74,0:49:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 不是 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.99,0:49:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.86,0:49:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地洞圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.87,0:49:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.62,0:49:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 有沒有什麼武器嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.86,0:49:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說我都是維護家庭和平
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.47,0:49:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以陽光未來為目標啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.23,0:49:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.90,0:49:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『消光暗燈』
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.91,0:49:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是好幫忙的機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.97,0:49:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.09,0:50:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家跟在我後面
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.20,0:49:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.09,0:50:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 你在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.99,0:50:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖 胖虎 你在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.05,0:50:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊 這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.80,0:50:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.45,0:50:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.32,0:50:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄拿著
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.74,0:50:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.66,0:50:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們給我老實點
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.02,0:50:28.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.12,0:50:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.37,0:50:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.87,0:50:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.13,0:51:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.65,0:51:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是有個三長兩短 我不會原諒你的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.04,0:51:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個不用你擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.88,0:51:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你聽我的話就不會有事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是貓傑啦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.84,0:51:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是貓傑啦遊樂園的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.82,0:51:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦左衛門之丞景虎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.55,0:51:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好長的名字呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.52,0:51:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在地下製造的是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.21,0:51:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是記載在...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.76,0:51:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗默示錄裡記載機器貓自然會明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.73,0:51:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是『時光機』
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.01,0:51:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 可以自由穿梭在時間和空間裡的方舟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.13,0:51:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有不可思議的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.78,0:51:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拿出不可思議的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.27,0:51:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的事情都寫在裏面
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.54,0:51:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.26,0:51:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我告訴你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.11,0:51:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千年前 我們貓傑啦族偉大的先祖
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.43,0:52:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落湯貓大人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.80,0:52:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落湯貓...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.21,0:52:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為被雨淋透 就叫落湯貓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.48,0:52:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.43,0:52:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 造那麼大的一個『時光機』要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.84,0:52:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大總統的發表時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.91,0:52:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽完了 我再告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.34,0:52:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬愛的貓狗國的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一個悲慘事實要告訴大家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.22,0:52:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在36小時候後 我們美麗的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.66,0:52:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將要面臨的是隕石群的撞擊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.57,0:52:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的隕石直徑有20千米
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.13,0:52:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的動植物將面臨死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.11,0:52:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地表將會受到大衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:52:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.08,0:53:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在21世紀消失的謎團終于解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.46,0:53:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這並不代表絕望了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.68,0:53:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們很早就察覺到了這個事實
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此早就準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.03,0:53:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是離開地球計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.50,0:53:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個計劃是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.82,0:53:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備可以容載全民眾
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.33,0:53:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開地球的宇宙船已經完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.78,0:53:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放進諾雷珠就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.23,0:53:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們移民到的星球是在大犬座的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,環境和地球很相近
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.11,0:53:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開這個美麗的地球是很心痛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.61,0:53:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望全民眾一起同心協力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.84,0:53:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出勇氣一起向新的世界出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.86,0:53:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了嗎 再拖下去就很不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.66,0:54:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢和小八到哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.75,0:54:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 你要幹什麽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.39,0:54:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好聽著 時間方舟已經造好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.38,0:54:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們已經沒有利用價值了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.25,0:54:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就乖乖地和地球一起滅亡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.29,0:54:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.46,0:54:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我們一族的目的地 不是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.81,0:54:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是通過『時光機』去未來
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.58,0:54:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未 未來
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對 就是去征服未來的人類世界
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.03,0:54:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓全人類成為我們的寵物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.14,0:54:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寵物 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.23,0:54:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在黑暗默示錄裡寫著
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.78,0:54:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一族的先祖 狗和貓
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.45,0:54:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是經歷了何等的殘酷對待
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.36,0:54:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類對於寵物 任意的爭奪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.26,0:55:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厭煩的時候就作為禮物送走或隨便丟棄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.00,0:55:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類是惡魔的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再讓人類待在這個地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.63,0:55:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是貓族的話 就應該幫助我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.68,0:55:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的事我怎麼可能幫你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.45,0:55:24.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就沒辦法了 你看看這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不同意的話 夏咪會怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.56,0:55:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好過份
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.22,0:55:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.19,0:56:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發是今天下午 大家冷靜跟著行動
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.78,0:56:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發時間是今天下午
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.07,0:56:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的計劃就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.39,0:56:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欺騙了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.32,0:56:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說只有你們離開嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.31,0:56:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是去未來
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.26,0:56:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要把人類怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.80,0:56:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣 機械的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.98,0:56:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.09,0:56:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是 『進化退化光線槍』
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.09,0:56:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我要你修好它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.20,0:56:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個可以把兇暴的人類退化成原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.14,0:57:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,征服起來就簡單了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.08,0:57:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修好這個 就可以救夏咪了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.07,0:57:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然這個時速300公里的軌車
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.34,0:57:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣從夏咪的身上開過
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.86,0:57:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麽能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.40,0:57:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.93,0:57:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.42,0:57:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修不修理『進化退化光線槍』
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.47,0:57:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.15,0:58:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個修好 那你也沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.86,0:58:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.04,0:58:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他打成廢鐵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.27,0:58:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 太好了你沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.73,0:58:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個機器貓還有用
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他不聽話的話到時再剷除也不遲
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.97,0:58:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難不成夏咪你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.34,0:58:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個難不成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.85,0:58:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這個機器貓關進『時光機』裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.47,0:58:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.84,0:58:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你竟然是他的同夥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.46,0:58:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.63,0:58:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶下去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.83,0:58:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.82,0:59:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣所有的準備都齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.91,0:59:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟 實行B計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.45,0:59:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.40,0:59:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B計劃是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.72,0:59:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將政府的諾雷珠搞到手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.12,0:59:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這麼做的話
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.37,0:59:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不就不能離開地球了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.50,0:59:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.26,0:59:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要啓動時間方舟是需要龐大的能源的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麽這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.30,0:59:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 你也是貓傑啦家族的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.50,0:59:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不許你反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.18,1:00:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是能源部
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.52,1:00:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾雷珠倉庫裏有可疑份子進入
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.36,1:00:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.36,1:00:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.41,1:00:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾雷珠被偷了 怎麼回事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.71,1:00:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是有人入侵了能源部
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.17,1:00:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搶走了脫出用的諾雷珠
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.95,1:00:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.86,1:00:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追查
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.49,1:00:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何都要找回來
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.30,1:00:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.73,1:00:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就要向地球告別了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.19,1:00:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得想個辦法離開這裏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.89,1:01:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 是小八
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.95,1:01:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能引開守衛的話
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.31,1:01:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對了 有個好東西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.04,1:01:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.17,1:01:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼東西 從什麼地方跑進來的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.97,1:01:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.34,1:01:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快趁現在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.10,1:01:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下那個按鈕
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.57,1:01:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.45,1:01:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 先出去再說
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.44,1:01:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢在那個東西裡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.12,1:02:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 科學家們逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.65,1:02:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這就去抓他們
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.93,1:02:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 讓他們去吧 反正不會有什麼事的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.45,1:02:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在已經萬事俱備 馬上就要出發了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.18,1:02:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出來了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們快去把這件事稟報大總統吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.03,1:02:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.85,1:02:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留在這裏
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.94,1:02:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去救哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.88,1:02:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丟下哆啦A夢不管
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.13,1:02:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是當然的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.86,1:02:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.19,1:02:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 我們也留下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.79,1:02:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.15,1:02:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.18,1:02:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽帶大家去大總統那吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.99,1:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 大家要小心呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.77,1:03:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.06,1:03:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.24,1:03:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.07,1:03:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看上面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個就是時間方舟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.14,1:03:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.59,1:03:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有什麼好辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.96,1:03:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 用掛在那裏的那個可以飛過去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.42,1:03:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一口氣衝上去的話
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.62,1:03:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以從那個軌道飛到那裡
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.39,1:03:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼定了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.30,1:04:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等用諾雷珠充電完成後 馬上就是時候了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.74,1:04:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來就拜託你們了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.34,1:04:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打開開關
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.60,1:04:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.97,1:04:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.49,1:04:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.70,1:04:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.16,1:04:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.92,1:04:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隕石
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.46,1:04:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隕石墜落了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.51,1:05:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.58,1:05:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.96,1:05:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.76,1:05:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.06,1:05:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.55,1:05:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.62,1:05:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪裡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.51,1:05:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是『時光機』的裏面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.36,1:05:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把引擎裝置關閉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.89,1:05:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.36,1:05:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我可不允許你們這樣做
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.98,1:06:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.35,1:06:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你幹什麼的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.13,1:06:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 等等 有了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名刀『電光丸』
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.16,1:06:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.14,1:06:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的劍術怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.00,1:06:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過其實是『電光丸』做的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.07,1:06:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心好了 你們只是昏過去而已
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.24,1:06:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 還有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.34,1:06:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個臭屁的小子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.93,1:06:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一點點
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.12,1:06:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 人類們覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.42,1:07:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.37,1:07:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.66,1:07:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.48,1:07:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦 你的對手是我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.72,1:07:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏交給我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.79,1:07:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又來攪局嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.26,1:07:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去卸引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.74,1:07:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.77,1:07:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點呀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.51,1:07:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請大家趕快進行緊急避難
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.32,1:07:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.41,1:07:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟了 沒電池了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.33,1:07:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勝負已分了 小哆啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個好像是引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.77,1:08:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.60,1:08:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好 我先過去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.09,1:08:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.69,1:08:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.34,1:08:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快點...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.56,1:08:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是夏咪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.09,1:08:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.90,1:08:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 去按下起飛桿 馬上起飛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.81,1:08:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.28,1:08:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.45,1:09:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.08,1:09:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.14,1:09:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.67,1:09:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.59,1:09:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滾開
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.75,1:09:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.41,1:09:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太過分了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.05,1:09:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.39,1:09:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.07,1:09:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦 我真的真的生氣了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.77,1:09:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你輸了 臭貓
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.98,1:09:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我輸了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.45,1:09:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 為了我 你要振作呀
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.77,1:10:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.50,1:10:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.75,1:10:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 你怎麼辦到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.90,1:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.90,1:10:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.40,1:10:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.36,1:11:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.91,1:11:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.13,1:11:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.20,1:11:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.86,1:11:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保證 明天我一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保證 我一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.09,1:11:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我為了這個約定一直在等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.85,1:12:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大總統 萬歲
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.67,1:12:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們馬上就可以見面了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.75,1:12:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.22,1:12:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.21,1:13:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 我就是小一
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.51,1:13:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.63,1:13:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.75,1:13:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 兩個都不會游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.45,1:13:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.38,1:13:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.17,1:13:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.21,1:13:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.22,1:13:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們好像還活著
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.40,1:13:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.87,1:13:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.42,1:13:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.77,1:13:58.93,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:14:04.08,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界沒有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.08,1:14:09.31,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-沒有可以束縛你的東西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.31,1:14:13.53,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你爲何如此緩慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.46,1:13:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.10,1:14:01.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.34,1:14:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 這個聲音應該是...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.53,1:14:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.74,1:14:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.82,1:14:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.82,1:14:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.88,1:14:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.85,1:14:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我相信你一定會回來的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.33,1:14:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你果然是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.49,1:14:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.77,1:14:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個你一直帶著啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.83,1:14:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.92,1:15:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 但是能實現這個約定太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.02,1:15:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄總算等到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.12,1:15:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是對方怎麼從一千年前...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.08,1:15:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思念的心情創造了奇跡
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.02,1:15:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.00,1:15:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.18,1:15:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.22,1:15:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 諾雷珠落在水裏了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.20,1:15:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說來...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.42,1:15:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諾雷珠踫到水就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.90,1:15:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 脫出用的宇宙船就不能啟動了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.90,1:15:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.08,1:15:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 不能想想辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.78,1:15:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.88,1:15:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.78,1:15:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.82,1:15:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是神？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.59,1:16:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我想起來了 大家不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們先去機場
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.23,1:16:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像神社的暗室一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.52,1:16:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 這就是創造我們國家的神
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.70,1:16:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是大雄呀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.32,1:16:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 那諾雷珠在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.60,1:17:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡 這個大雄像全部都是用諾雷珠做的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.57,1:17:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.35,1:17:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從頭到腳都是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.93,1:17:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒時間了 大家快點
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.90,1:17:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危險啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.90,1:17:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.54,1:17:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加速了 大家抓緊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.09,1:17:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類啊 現在給我掉入黑暗中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.67,1:17:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓傑啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.19,1:17:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹掉你們
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.19,1:18:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.02,1:18:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.21,1:18:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 我拉著
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.06,1:18:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就讓你自由
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.25,1:18:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是隧道 得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.01,1:18:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他還在追
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.69,1:18:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.83,1:18:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.68,1:18:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.51,1:18:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手不能鬆開 不能掏道具了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我們沒關係的 你們快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.19,1:19:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.25,1:19:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢 我幫你拿道具
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.13,1:19:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.74,1:19:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.93,1:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.02,1:19:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.54,1:19:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.64,1:19:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下有趣了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.17,1:19:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.17,1:19:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想辦法
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.18,1:19:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 拿著那個劍玉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.57,1:19:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.11,1:19:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向盤拜託了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.52,1:20:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.79,1:20:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我下一招
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.69,1:20:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 用劍玉直接瞄準他的頭部
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.17,1:20:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.43,1:20:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 FULL POWER
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.06,1:20:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.56,1:20:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.96,1:20:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生...喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.53,1:20:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.55,1:20:33.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大燈』
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.59,1:21:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快點
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.86,1:21:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員都上去了 隨時都可以出發
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.97,1:21:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『時光機』也修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.94,1:21:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是幫了很多忙 我代表民眾們萬分感謝
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.63,1:21:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.14,1:21:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 這次真的要分手了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.69,1:22:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 和我們一起回21世紀 好嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.35,1:22:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個不行
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有責任和大家一起到新的地球上建立新的國家
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.99,1:22:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個別人也可以做的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.32,1:22:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要再為難他了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.79,1:22:27.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像小一這樣進化的人型狗不可以帶到21世紀的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如哆啦A夢所說的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.92,1:22:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不可以去改變人類的歷史
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.51,1:22:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.44,1:22:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.65,1:22:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.17,1:22:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.52,1:22:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.12,1:22:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古 太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.04,1:22:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.58,1:22:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 我不會忘了你的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.86,1:22:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.37,1:22:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重呀 知子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.77,1:23:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達古 不要感冒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.98,1:23:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫才是 不要再只穿內衣外出呀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.15,1:23:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.37,1:23:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.39,1:23:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出發了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.34,1:23:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.52,1:23:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}再見了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.38,1:23:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.13,1:23:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.94,1:23:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.35,1:23:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.56,1:23:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.73,1:23:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.63,1:23:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.16,1:24:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.69,1:24:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 烏龜先生 烏龜先生喲-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.15,1:24:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界沒有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.59,1:24:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-沒有可以束縛你的東西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.87,1:24:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你爲何如此緩慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.55,1:25:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球在46億年間有多少事在重複著
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.81,1:25:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誕生之后消亡 馬上又會有新的生命誕生
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.29,1:25:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.53,1:25:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爺爺奶奶 也有爸爸媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.63,1:25:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們將來也會變成爸爸媽媽、爺爺奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.90,1:25:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.91,1:25:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許說不定什麼時候 我們的子孫
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.92,1:25:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和小一的子孫會在宇宙的某個地方相遇
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.12,1:25:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.25,1:25:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.41,1:29:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(566,450)\fs18}HKG & LLOUP 製作於2006 冬 [聖誕]
